OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after school receives
OL,4,Athreatening call
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a primary
OL,7,Fschool was forced to close when staff
OL,8,Freceived a threatening call.
OL,10,FEarl Spencer Primary School in
OL,11,FStreatfield Road, Northampton, went
OL,12,Finto lockdown on Wednesday after
OL,13,Freceiving "a suspicious call from
OL,14,Fsomeone making threats" just after
OL,15,F11:15 BST, police said.
OL,17,FA 46-year-old man from London, arrested
OL,18,Fon suspicion of malicious
OL,19,Fcommunications has since been
OL,20,Ftransferred into the care of health
OL,21,Fprofessionals, police said.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
