OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after school receives
OL,4,Athreatening call
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Nic Davis-Lyons said any threat
OL,7,Fagainst a school was "taken extremely
OL,8,Fseriously" and thanked pupils, parents
OL,9,Fand school staff.
